{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2021-10-27 17:28:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL CORPORATION DECLARES THIRD QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': "HOUSTON, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MARATHON OIL CORPORATION (NYSE: MRO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 6 CENTS PER SHARE ON MARATHON OIL CORPORATION COMMON STOCK. THIS REPRESENTS A 20% INCREASE FROM THE COMPANY'S LAST QUARTERLY BASE DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 5 CENTS PER SHARE."}